# OPERATIONS §2 "For all three": a path is a file or a directory, every *.tally file under it. `check d` takes the
# model and its scenario under d (the base and scenario of L6_4_ask_alone_with_scenarios_all, q_low left out): both
# load, every ask's own checks passed: `ok`, exit 0. Run as the command line runs it.
=== options disk check paths=d exit=0
=== d/model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "a model and a scenario over it (invented)"

source card "a card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN = amt + amt at reader

ask q: doubled law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
=== d/scen/scen.tally
scenario raised over household
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version raise_2027
  cite card
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-02-01
  replace amt = 150.00 PLN "a raise from 2027"

ask q_raised: doubled in raised law 2027-06-01
=== expect
ok
